A||N||4||Elenor84||Would my thermistat make my radiator hoses burst?||||3||
Z||000000||Elenor84||12-24-2001||06:43 AM||||Hey guys...the other day a hose burst(driverside lower section along the side)so I replaced it and refilled the coolent.  Again today I was driving and all of a sudden my temp went redline...so I pulled over and sure enough I was leaking coolent...but this time from my lower radiator hose...2 hoses in 2 days...could it be because of my thermastat and the presure?  I'm going to replace it tomorrow and should I get a new thermastat?  <BR>Why do my hoses keep bursting?  Thx!<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||3
Z||000001||Phil||12-24-2001||06:47 AM||||Thermostat controls water temp.<BR>Rad. cap controls water pressure<BR>Age controls hose strength<P>Replace all 3||||reg||1
Z||000002||rogergarrison||12-24-2001||06:58 AM||||Ya, just coincidence, all your hoses are prob same age. When you put on new one, put more strain on the other. Id be checking the others like heater hoses too, prob not too far behind although some arent exposed to the same amount of heat.||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||12-24-2001||04:36 PM||||actually,,, if the Tstat was missing or jammed open, a new one could cause weak hoses to fail. A stuck/missing Tstat would keep system pressure lower because the water can't heat up as it should.<P>Either way those, and likely all other, hoses were on their way to dead. I'd replace all the rubber line at this time. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Elenor84||12-24-2001||05:38 PM||||Alright, thx alot for your help guys...<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
